        "x0": 74.7,
        "x1": 299.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B Reacting to other people’s emotions"
      },
      {
        "y": 211.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 515.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Lottie tried to defuse the tension by changing the subject. [make a dangerous or tense situation calmer]"
      },
      {
        "y": 223.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 494.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Tim was very angry with his daughter and it took her a long time to placate him. [stop someone"
