        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 150.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "feeling angry]"
      },
      {
        "y": 247.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 504.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "An independent advisor has been brought in to conciliate between the unions and the employer."
